      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents consistently praise Dr Pearson, Dr Schweers, and the veterinary nurses for their thorough examinations and welcoming attitude. Reviewers highlight that doctors take time to discuss diagnoses and treatment options without upselling unnecessary tests. Although one client experienced an unsatisfactory grooming visit, overall client impressions of the staff are exceptionally high."
      },
