      "title": {
        "en": "Patient care for anxious pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently note how comfortably their dogs and cats are treated during visits. Multiple reviewers mention that pets who are normally timid or nervous around clinical environments relaxed quickly thanks to gentle handling and patient encouragement from the technical team."
      },
      "mentions": 12,
      "sentiment": "positive"
    },
    {
