      "title": {
        "en": "Reliable treatments and clinical recovery"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers report positive medical outcomes for routine health checkups, pet surgeries, and emergency evaluations. Several owners highlight successful treatment plans that helped their animals recover from sudden illnesses, though one client noted disappointment with grooming results."
      },
      "mentions": 10,
      "sentiment": "positive"
